OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FMostly dry and cloudy, with
OL,6,Flimited sunny breaks. Rain across
OL,7,FScotland will ease, except in the
OL,8,Fnortheast, and showers will arrive for
OL,9,Fthe northwest. Some drizzle in the far
OL,10,Fsouth later. Feeling cold,
OL,11,Fparticularly along the windy North Sea
OL,12,Fcoasts.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FShowers will persist along
OL,15,Fsome Scottish coasts, and will also
OL,16,Farrive in northeast England. Cold and
OL,17,Fmostly cloudy. Under any clear spells,
OL,18,Ftemperatures will fall further to
OL,19,Fbring frost.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
